# JZS Brawl - smali injection patch
#
# Target file (after apktool d base.apk):
#     smali/com/supercell/titan/GameApp.smali
#
# What it does:
#     Adds an invoke-static to com.jzs.brawl.JZSInit.install(this) at the
#     end of GameApp.onCreate(Landroid/os/Bundle;)V, so that our overlay
#     TextView "JZS V1 (lastest)" is drawn on top of the Titan surface.
#
# Instructions:
#     1. apktool d com.supercell.brawlstars.apk -o work/
#     2. Open work/smali/com/supercell/titan/GameApp.smali
#     3. Locate the method:
#            .method public onCreate(Landroid/os/Bundle;)V
#        find the LAST `return-void` inside that method body and INSERT
#        the two lines below IMMEDIATELY BEFORE that `return-void`.
#     4. Copy compiled com/jzs/brawl/*.smali into work/smali/ preserving
#        package layout (see build/build_mod.sh which does this for you).
#     5. Copy libjz.so into work/lib/<abi>/libjz.so for each ABI.
#     6. apktool b work/ -o jzs-brawl-unsigned.apk
#     7. zipalign + apksigner (see build/build_mod.sh).

# --- BEGIN INJECTION (insert before final return-void of onCreate) ---
    invoke-static {p0}, Lcom/jzs/brawl/JZSInit;->install(Landroid/app/Activity;)V
# --- END INJECTION ---
